r tandems and quit the race just after the start. " [:a {:href "/athletes/890854"} "Constant Huret"] " crashed after 7 km and was out of the race, and " [:a {:href "/athletes/890020"} "Andresse"] " followed him “soon after.” The next out of the race was " [:a {:href "/athletes/890299"} "Arthur Chase"] ", who was in the lead at the time when he lost contact with his tandem."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The pack then rode together for most of the race, although there were several accidents when riders hit tandems and crashed. The 30 km mark was passed in 30:15.2, while the 40 km mark was done in 39:46.6, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/890519"} "Piet Dickentman"] " leading. At 45 km, " [:a {:href "/athletes/891412"} "Thaddäus Robl"] " attacked and dropped all the remaining riders, except Dickentman and " [:a {:href "/athletes/890172"} "Émile Bouhours"] ". He gradually rode them off his wheel, and Robl ended up ¾ lap ahead of Dickentman in second, with Bouhours finishing another 150 metres back. Dickentman protested the outcome, stating that he had been interfered with by Arthur Chase, but the protest was not allowed. Robl won 1,200 francs, with Dickentman receiving 800 francs, and Bouhours 500."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/891412"} "Thaddäus Robl"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "49:57.4"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:class "footnote", :href "#", :title "There were 14 entrants. We have 13 starters.", :data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right"} "1"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/890519"} "Piet Dickentman"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-righ